  {
   "id": "fresh-tracks-335842@major-2025-09-03",
   "gameId": "fresh-tracks-335842",
   "displayName": "Update Notes for September 3rd 2025",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-03T14:04:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks for playing Fresh Tracks! We’ve pushed a small update addressing a few issues players have reported:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes & Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "True Ending Achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the achievement for completing the true ending was not unlocking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "For players who have already finished the game: re-loading your save file should retroactively unlock the achievement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We don’t believe you’ll need to re-beat the game, but due to the complexity of testing first-time unlocks vs. retroactive saves, we can’t 100% guarantee.: Shortcut Headers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shortcut text now correctly displays as “Shortcut” no matter which boss is skipped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Previously, all shortcut headers incorrectly showed “Skuld Kyng.”: Player Type Menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On PC, the Player Type selection screen (Traveller, Explorer, Adventurer, Champion) when starting a new game from the Main Menu, was incorrectly labeled as “Difficulty.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "In Fresh Tracks, “Difficulty” should only refer to the marked difficulty of a Story Song: Easy, Medium, Hard, Expert, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This bug was introduced when localization was added for other languages. It has now been fixed and the menu properly says “Player Type.”: Prologue Screens",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Version Number no longer appears on Mythic prologue screens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It now only displays in the Main Menu (except for Koda’s prologue, which takes place in the Main Menu and still shows it).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
